Maintenance Announcement (May 30, 2025)
Commanders,
We will be conducting maintenance for Iron Saga VS on Steam from 16:00 UTC+8. Online play will not be available during the maintenance. You can still play in offline mode.

Maintenance Period:
From 16:30 to 17:30 UTC+8 (~60 minutes)

If the maintenance is not finished by the scheduled time, we may extend the maintenance. We're sorry for any inconvenience this may cause. Thanks again for your understanding and support.

Patch Note 1.1.0r1_0(May 30, 2025)
CUTIN ANIMATION
· Added new CUTIN animations for Kaguya in Arsenal: Crimson Moon - Crimson Scatter (↓↙←↓↙←+D) and Moonlit Starry Night (↓↘→↓↘→+C while jumping)

BUG FIX
· Fixed Getter-2's Crouching Medium Attack (↓+B) being unable to be crushed by high counters;
· Fixed the throw escape enabled by inputs like ↓+AD, →+AD, etc. turning into ↓+D, →+D, etc. under Dancouga's DancouHo Formation Arsenal;
· Fixed the final attack of Getter-2's Getter Change Attack (↓↘→↓↘→+D) missing after Getter-3 changing into Getter-2 under limit break following Getter-3's (Heavy) Heaving Crusher;
· Fixed Susanoo's Magatsu · Kamui Slash (↓↘→+BC) failing to take effect after (Medium) Kamui Slash hits the target;
· Fixed the throw escape during recovery of certain moves made possible with a throw-enabled counter from the opponent;
· Fixed the throw escape against Vassago's normal throws under Limiter Removed Arsenal made possible in any cases when Vassago's limiter is removed and overloaded;
· Fixed the throw escape against Kaguya's back throw made possible in any cases;
· Fixed Wu Shuang turning around in the corner immediately after All-conquering (↓↙←+D) under Wu Shuang's Autocracy of Gunfire Arsenal hitting the target at a certain range.
· Fixed Mazinger Jump (↓↑+A/B) prioritizing Great Typhoon (↓↑+AB) following certain moves for Great Mazinger in its Combat Pro Arsenal.

