Patch Note 1.0.24.1 (May 20, 2025)
BUG FIX
· Fixed the Crouch Heavy Attack (↓+C) of Great Mazinger being unable to crush High counters;
· Fixed the phase 1 of Crouch Medium Attack (↓+B) being unable to crush High counters;
· Fixed the phase 1 attack of Reverse Kasaya (→+C) of Kaguya being immune to High counters;
· Fixed the extended pushback distance resulting from errored interaction between Qing Long's Crescent Ambush (↓↙←↓↙←+D) under Dust Annihilation arsenal and some of the opponent's moves in the corner;
· Fixed Stargazer Chase (↓↘→+AB) under Kaguya's Darkwing arsenal possessing extended invincibility toward projectiles to align with the Command List;
· Fixed unplugging of the controllers while holding buttons not depleting the inputs;
· Fixed the overlapped BGM with videos being played one immediately after another;
· Fixed the error while watching replays when trying to restart the video with pressed buttons or through the menu;
· Fixed the ghost appearance of disconnected players in the Battle Room;
· Fixed the inaccurate command title in Susanoo's General Combo (General Combo #6);
· Fixed monthly mission failing to refresh;

IMPROVEMENTS
· Prioritized the command Spinning Boomerang (↓↑+D) under Great Mazinger's [Combat Pro] arsenal in certain combos to avoid unintended jumps after the input;
· Password-gated private room now supports a password-free entry for invited players;
· Private Room now supports custom rules for vacant decks.
· Battle Room now offers the option of the Command List.
· Improved the Menu in Single Player mode;

Iron Saga Team
