Patch Note 1.0.5.1 (March 26, 2025)
BUG FIXES
· Fixed the problem that Steam Deck would crash at the end of the tutorial video in Tutorial, Command List, and Mech Info;
· Fixed the lagging at the appearance of the blue GTW fighter in a dual Nero match where both Neros are using the same Arsenal: GTW Fighter Duo;
· Fixed the problem of having a window period of up to 12 frames granted to the opponent to perform a throw escape;
· Fixed the problem when Nero is performing a back throw, the enemy would stay airborne at the 6th frame;
· Fixed the game not responding when defeating the enemy with Nero's Arsenal: GTW Fighter Duo;
· Fixed the synchronization problem in a fight of high pings;
· Fixed the problem where Players cannot enter the game due to 'User permission does not match';
· Fixed the problem when the mech's coating does not accord with the preset coating, returning to the character select would lock the coating permanently;
· Fixed the problem that by pressing Return at the end of the replay, players would end up in the Main Menu;
· Fixed the problem that during a replay or match-spectating, opening the menu would enable the Attack Data and Input History;
· Fixed the problem that by hiding HUD in a replay, the default speed would be set as 1;
· Fixed the visual error when Wu Shuang's Divine Demon Severance hit the Simulacrum unit summoned by the opponent's Nero in its Arsenal: Simulacrum;
· Fixed the wrong hurtboxes of certain characters.

Iron Saga VS Operations Team

Commanders!
As of the time of writing, we have identified and confirmed the following problems:

Known Problems:
· SteamDeck would crash at the end of the tutorial video in Tutorial, Command List, and Mech Info;
· Lagging at the appearance of the blue GTW fighter in a dual Nero match where both Neros are using the same Arsenal: GTW Fighter Duo;
· The problem of having a window period of up to 12 frames granted to the opponent to perform a throw escape;
· When Nero is performing a back throw, the enemy would stay airborne at the 6th frame;
· Game not responding when defeating the enemy with Nero's Arsenal: GTW Fighter Duo;
· Synchronization problem in a fight of high pings;
· Players cannot enter the game due to 'User permission does not match';
· When the mech's coating does not accord with the preset coating, returning to the character select would lock the coating permanently;
· By pressing Return at the end of the replay, players would end up in the Main Menu;
· During a replay or match-spectating, opening the menu would enable the Attack Data and Input History;
· By hiding HUD in a replay, the default speed would be set as 1;

There will be an update trying to address the problems listed above
Sorry for any inconvenience these have caused! Thanks for your support!

Iron Saga VS Operations Team

Maintenance Announcement (March 24, 2025)
Commanders,
We will be conducting maintenance for Iron Saga VS on Steam from 18:50 UTC+8. Online play will not be available during the maintenance. You can still play in offline mode.

Maintenance Period:
From 18:50 to 19:20 UTC +8 ( 30minutes)

If the maintenance is not finished by the scheduled time, we may extend the maintenance. We're sorry for any inconvenience this may cause. Thanks again for your understanding and support.

Patch Note (March 24, 2025)
BUG FIXES
· Fixed the problem where projectiles released will be rendered mecha coating of the opponent when both parties are using the same character;
· Fixed the problem when Boss Borot's Brave Rocket is being blocked by the Energy Shield launched by the opponent, Boss Borot cannot detach from being airborne;
· Fixed the error when Boss Borot's Brave Rocket is being launched, its detachment from the rocket would result in a synchronization problem;
· Fixed the screen turning darker in the second round during a Multiplayer match;
· Fixed the problem when Wu Shuang receives damage, it would bend its head in a reverse angle in animation;
· Fixed errors that may give rise to the visual problems about EN bar;
· Fixed the pop-up notification of 'Your Opponent has left' in the settlement page during Ranked Matches and Casual Matches;
· Fixed the renewed matches in an ongoing match in Ranked Match and Casual Match;
· Fixed the problem where both parties choose the same character in Single Play, a visual problem may occur;
· Fixed the problem when trying to filter with Win and Lose, settings cannot be returned;
· Fixed some localization problems about moveset of certain characters;
· Fixed the problem when the text box is empty, it cannot be closed; 
· Fixed the problem when players are spectating a match, they may not be able to enter the next match-spectating.
· Fixed the potential error screen during spectating;
· Fixed the problem of failing to follow the continuing storyline in Chapter 8 in Arcade - Mephisto;
· Fixed the lack of hurtbox at the end of Vassago's crouch block in Arsenal: Limiter Removed

IMPROVEMENTS
· Added the pause of matchmaking while players are staying at Gachapon, Leaderboard, Announcement, etc.
· Improved some sound effects;
· Improved the avatar and animated mecha showcase while players are engaging in a fight around the deck.
· Adjusted the AI level in Easy mode during Arcade; The opponet level at stage 8 will be set Lv.3
· Fixed AI opponent at Lv.4 and Lv.5.

BALANCE ADJUSTMENTS
-Boss Borot
· Before Boss Borot's Power Max Supermove - Brave Rocket in Arsenal: Boss's Treasure is launched, it is no longer defined as a projectile and thus cannot be nullified by projectile immunity skills;
· Fixed the problem where Boss Borot's Power Max Supermove - Brave Rocket in Arsenal: Rolling Tactics is launched, items in Boss's Treasure could be produced in the wake of the explosion in certain cases;

-Wu Shuang
· Changed Advantage on Hit of WuShuag's Execution from -4 to ±0; Changed the frame on block form -10 to -7 with total frames less 3;
· When Break Boost in Arsenal: Lightning Overlord is performed, the following light attack would release Divine Punishment;

-Nero
· Changed the advantage on hit of the second phase of Nero's heavy attack while standing from +1 to +4 in line with the first phase;
· Fixed Nero being counter thrown when it performs High-Density Simulacrum Cluster in Arsenal: Simulacrum;
· Fixed Nero gaining invincibility on startup and immunity to the the enemy during damage recovery.

Iron Saga VS Operations Team
